# ODS 只读 SQL 模式

```sql
SELECT c.owner, c.table_name, c.column_name, c.data_type,
       c.data_length, c.nullable, c.column_id
FROM all_tab_columns c
WHERE c.owner = :owner AND c.table_name = :table_name
ORDER BY c.column_id;
```

```sql
SELECT *
FROM (
  SELECT t.col_a, t.col_b
  FROM owner.table_name t
  WHERE t.business_key = :business_key
  ORDER BY t.col_a
)
WHERE ROWNUM <= :limit;
```

生成关系验证 SQL 时必须带业务键、时间范围或 `ROWNUM` 上限；先验证计数和键分布，再输出样例。不得对大表直接 `COUNT(*)` 或无条件扫描。

