1:"""144 S6: unified AI context building + snapshot persistence.
3:filter_ai_readable is the unconditional first gate for EVERY AI-facing object
4:list (144 §4.6): ai_readable=False drops; missing flag fails closed (treated
5:as not readable) until governance backfills the value.
7:build_context_snapshot assembles the versioned ai-data-context/v1 document
8:from certified/current platform assets only — never raw SQL unless explicitly
9:authorized, never patient-level data.
10:"""
